        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Franciscan Friars, St. John the Baptist Province, Archbishop of Cincinnati\n- Companies: Franciscan Media, NewBay Media\n- Products: St. Anthony Messenger, Revolver, Servant books, Catholic Greetings, Saint of the Day, Minute Meditations, AmericanCatholic.org\n- Places: Cincinnati, Ohio, United States\n- Topics: Roman Catholic family magazines, rock and heavy metal magazines, multimedia publishing\n\nFacts:\n- St. Anthony Messenger is a national Roman Catholic family magazine published in Cincinnati, Ohio, in the United States by the Franciscan Friars of St. John the Baptist Province.\n- St. Anthony Messenger has the explicit ecclesiastical approval of the Archbishop of Cincinnati.\n- Revolver is a bi-monthly rock and heavy metal magazine published by NewBay Media.\n- Franciscan Media was formerly named St. Anthony Messenger Press.\n- Franciscan Media is a multimedia company that includes St. Anthony Messenger magazine, Franciscan Media and Servant books, Catholic Greetings, Saint of the Day, Minute Meditations, and AmericanCatholic.org.\n- Franciscan Media products are used by millions of people primarily in the United States and also worldwide.",
